{"title": "Bardic Defence", "pageid": 31159, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bardic_Defence", "categories": ["Free actions", "Class actions", "Reactions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bardic_Defence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Bardic_Defence.webp/300px-Bardic_Defence.webp, /w/images/e/e8/Bardic_Defence.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Bardic_Defence.webp/300px-Bardic_Defence.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Bardic_Defence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bardic Defence</b> is a reaction granted by having a <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(resource)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (resource)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add a <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d6</span> bonus to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a>. \n</p><p>You will expend your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Bardic_Inspiration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(class_action)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (class action)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> when the effect triggers.\n</p><p><br>\n \n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_Higher_Levels\">At Higher Levels</span></h2>\n<p>When the <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> reaches Level 5, the bonus increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d8</span>\n</p><p>When the <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> reaches Level 10, the bonus increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d10</span> \n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Defence\" title=\"Bardic Defence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Defence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Bardic_Defence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bardic Defence</a> is only available as long as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> condition is active.</li></ul>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1436/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12295/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5748/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0